1
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,350
(Tram drop-off)

2
00:00:36,389 --> 00:00:39,364
=Vow of Autumn=
=Episode 3=

3
00:00:39,899 --> 00:00:40,619
Wen Wanqing.

4
00:00:41,979 --> 00:00:43,219
You need to take responsibility.

5
00:00:44,859 --> 00:00:45,420
What?

6
00:00:45,759 --> 00:00:46,600
About last night,

7
00:00:47,359 --> 00:00:49,100
you can't pretend nothing happened.

8
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:51,740
You're my best friend's brother.

9
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:53,039
I watched you grow up.

10
00:00:53,039 --> 00:00:54,479
What responsibility do I owe you?

11
00:00:55,340 --> 00:00:55,840
Besides...

12
00:00:56,799 --> 00:00:57,859
You should call me sis.

13
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:04,219
You're not my sister by blood.

14
00:01:05,180 --> 00:01:06,439
I'm allowed to like you.

15
00:01:33,013 --> 00:01:35,420
(Let's meet.
Zhou Ze: Qiting Book Cafe)

16
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:40,900
Take me somewhere first.

17
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:26,159
Wanqing.

18
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,919
You're here. Have a seat.

19
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:33,580
I ordered you a hot Americano

20
00:02:33,900 --> 00:02:35,699
and your favorite Basque cheesecake.

21
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:38,240
Your wife came to my firm today,

22
00:02:38,580 --> 00:02:39,900
splashed red paint and wrote insults.

23
00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:40,979
Did you know that?

24
00:02:42,259 --> 00:02:43,240
I had no idea.

25
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:43,939
Why...

26
00:02:43,939 --> 00:02:45,120
I don't care if you knew.

27
00:02:45,860 --> 00:02:47,439
I'm here to tell you

28
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:49,960
to keep me out of your mess.

29
00:02:50,180 --> 00:02:51,500
What happened today

30
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:52,879
has damaged my reputation.

31
00:02:53,539 --> 00:02:54,479
Please let her know.

32
00:02:55,099 --> 00:02:56,939
Next time, I'll sue for defamation

33
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:58,120
and reputational harm.

34
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:59,539
Every last claim.

35
00:03:01,479 --> 00:03:02,240
Wanqing.

36
00:03:02,439 --> 00:03:03,659
Give me one more chance, please.

37
00:03:03,659 --> 00:03:04,400
Just one.

38
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,599
I really do love you.

39
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:06,599
Let go.

40
00:03:06,740 --> 00:03:08,080
Can't you give me one more chance?

41
00:03:08,159 --> 00:03:08,960
Let go!

42
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,520
I finally got you to meet me.

43
00:03:10,620 --> 00:03:11,300
Please.

44
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:17,120
She said let go.

45
00:03:17,900 --> 00:03:18,780
Didn't you hear her?

46
00:03:23,039 --> 00:03:23,919
Who are you?

47
00:03:29,819 --> 00:03:30,780
I never thought

48
00:03:31,199 --> 00:03:32,500
you'd move on so fast.

49
00:03:33,780 --> 00:03:35,539
Keeping a boy toy now?

50
00:03:36,379 --> 00:03:37,219
What can he give you?

51
00:03:37,719 --> 00:03:39,560
Late-night heart-to-hearts?

52
00:03:40,039 --> 00:03:41,680
Or queue with you for egg tarts?

53
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:44,759
Wanqing.

54
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,879
You're a smart woman.

55
00:03:47,340 --> 00:03:48,819
You know what kind of man

56
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,400
is right for you.

57
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:52,199
Don't just find a rebound

58
00:03:52,780 --> 00:03:54,659
to spite me and get through a dry spell.

59
00:04:02,599 --> 00:04:04,300
Oh, I forgot to tell you.

60
00:04:04,759 --> 00:04:06,539
I only slapped you once yesterday.

61
00:04:07,099 --> 00:04:08,560
I thought about it all night.

62
00:04:08,919 --> 00:04:09,960
I could've done better.

63
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:10,919
I barely slept.

64
00:04:11,479 --> 00:04:14,120
This coffee is for good measure.

65
00:04:45,819 --> 00:04:47,139
He's better than you in every way.

66
00:04:52,100 --> 00:04:52,740
Excuse me.

67
00:04:53,399 --> 00:04:54,040
Check, please.

68
00:04:58,319 --> 00:04:59,120
Put it on my tab.

69
00:04:59,699 --> 00:05:00,500
Of course, sir.

70
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:06,759
Let's go. Take me home.

71
00:05:19,079 --> 00:05:19,839
Pei Yiqiu.

72
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:30,800
What?

73
00:05:31,399 --> 00:05:32,720
Upset I used you back there?

74
00:05:36,439 --> 00:05:37,399
Being used by you?

75
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,180
My pleasure.

76
00:05:52,459 --> 00:05:53,220
Watch your head.

77
00:06:26,079 --> 00:06:26,939
But...

78
00:06:27,519 --> 00:06:28,939
if you need me to put on an act again,

79
00:06:29,439 --> 00:06:30,660
give me a heads-up.

80
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,480
With some preparation,

81
00:06:33,839 --> 00:06:35,360
I'd be more convincing.

82
00:06:45,940 --> 00:06:48,553
(Cheng A J5630)

83
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,000
Where are my egg tarts?

84
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,339
They're probably a bit cold by now.

85
00:07:20,740 --> 00:07:21,180
It's fine.

86
00:07:31,899 --> 00:07:34,100
Are you okay today?

87
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:35,800
The red paint.

88
00:07:39,019 --> 00:07:41,240
I just feel sorry for his wife.

89
00:07:41,740 --> 00:07:43,279
Why do women hurt other women?

90
00:07:43,579 --> 00:07:44,980
She shouldn't target me.

91
00:07:46,259 --> 00:07:47,740
I did lose a case,

92
00:07:48,139 --> 00:07:48,980
but it's fine.

93
00:07:49,259 --> 00:07:50,259
I'll get it back.

94
00:08:00,579 --> 00:08:01,300
Wen Wanqing.

95
00:08:03,220 --> 00:08:04,579
I have a secret to tell you.

96
00:08:04,899 --> 00:08:05,540
What is it?

97
00:08:06,060 --> 00:08:07,660
Promise me one thing first.

98
00:08:07,839 --> 00:08:08,839
Tell me what it is.

99
00:08:09,939 --> 00:08:11,019
Could you

100
00:08:11,379 --> 00:08:12,699
just see me

101
00:08:13,019 --> 00:08:14,779
as a man who wants to date you?

102
00:08:15,439 --> 00:08:16,560
Not as Su Mu's brother.

103
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:17,199
Just...

104
00:08:19,500 --> 00:08:20,480
a regular man.

105
00:08:21,660 --> 00:08:22,379
Like,

106
00:08:23,860 --> 00:08:25,379
let me call you Wanqing, not sis.

107
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,460
Tell me first.

108
00:08:32,460 --> 00:08:33,919
Then I'll think about it.

109
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,840
Nothing happened last night.

110
00:08:52,620 --> 00:08:53,620
What?

111
00:09:17,273 --> 00:09:18,740
(Tram drop-off)
